        <body>
            <div xml:id="d894">

                <pb facs="0875" n="709" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg709"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/2043</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of the Navy to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Navy Department</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-08-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 8, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Secretary of the Navy presents his compliments to the Honorable the Secretary
                    of State, and desires that I forward herewith for the information of the
                    Department of State a copy of the Annual Report of the Military Government of
                    Santo Domingo from date of Proclamation, November 29, 1916, to June 30,
                    1917.</p>
                <p>Very respectfully,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">C. Belknap</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Lieutenant Commander, U. S. N.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d894-a1.xml" xpointer="d894-a1"/>
            </div>
